Added a driver for the Rigol DHO900 series oscilloscopes (DHO914, DHO914S, DHO924, DHO924S), with a PyVISA-sim model. It covers the channels, time base, acquisition, edge and pulse trigger, waveform readout from the display and from the memory, the automatic measurements, the frequency counter, the voltmeter and the built-in function generator, including its Bode plot and a frequency response measured from the waveforms by a sine fit, with a through calibration of the channel skew and gain. Tested on a DHO914S with firmware 00.01.04; the module docstring lists where the firmware departs from the programming guide and how the driver handles it.
